    '["Hydration","Anti-Aging"]', '["https://cms.beautybooth.com.bd/uploads/all/eWVmtJs8ScTEZ5DbAkUxPdxuj7t4KKeIll9f3KlE.jpg","https://cms.beautybooth.com.bd/uploads/all/eWVmtJs8ScTEZ5DbAkUxPdxuj7t4KKeIll9f3KlE.jpg"]', 'https://cms.beautybooth.com.bd/uploads/all/eWVmtJs8ScTEZ5DbAkUxPdxuj7t4KKeIll9f3KlE.jpg',
    'Collagen And Hyaluronic Acid Ampoule — FARMSTAY | Petal & Rose', 'A lightweight concentrated ampoule that delivers a high dose of potent actives to visibly improve skin tone and texture.');
