    VALUES ('COS-AHABHA-TON-150', 'Cosrx AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner', 'cosrx-cosrx-aha-bha-clarifying-treatment-toner', 13, 1,
    'Skincare', 'Toner', '150 ml',
    'Cosrx AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner by COSRX — a toner curated for the modern skincare routine. A refreshing toner that rebalances skin, preps it for the rest of your routine and improves the look of texture and pores. Presented in a 150 ml size for consistent, everyday use.', 'A refreshing toner that rebalances skin, preps it for the rest of your routine and improves the look of texture and pores.', 1400, 1400, 33,
    3, 'published', 0, 0, 1, 1,
    4.7, 60, '["skincare","CellImage"]', '["Water, Salix Alba (Willow) Bark Water, Pyrus Malus (Apple) Fruit Water, Butylene Glycol, 1,2-Hexanediol, Sodium Lactate, Glycolic Acid, Betaine Salicylate, Allantoin, Panthenol, Ethyl Hexanediol."]',
    '["Balance & prep","Improves overall skin tone & texture","Suitable for daily use"]', 'Cleanser দিয়ে মুখ পরিষ্কার করার পর একটি cotton pad-এ পর্যাপ্ত পরিমাণ toner spray করুন। এরপর চোখ ও ঠোঁটের চারপাশের অংশ এড়িয়ে মুখে আলতোভাবে wipe করুন। অতিরিক্ত ঘষাঘষি না করে productটি ত্বকে কাজ করতে দিন। দিনের বেলা ব্যবহার করলে broad-spectrum sunscreen SPF 30 বা তার বেশি ব্যবহার করুন। একই routine-এ অন্যান্য AHA, BHA, Retinol ও Vitamin C-এর সঙ্গে এটি ব্যবহার না করাই ভালো।', '["Dry","Oily","Combination","Normal","Sensitive"]',
    '["Brightening","Acne & Texture"]', '["https://e-mart.com.bd/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fe-mart.com.bd%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F03%2Femart-cosrx-aha-bha-clarifying-treatment-toner-50ml.jpg&w=1920&q=85","https://e-mart.com.bd/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fe-mart.com.bd%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F03%2Femart-cosrx-aha-bha-clarifying-treatment-toner-50ml.jpg&w=1920&q=85"]', 'https://e-mart.com.bd/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fe-mart.com.bd%2Fwp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F03%2Femart-cosrx-aha-bha-clarifying-treatment-toner-50ml.jpg&w=1920&q=85',
    'Cosrx AHA/BHA Clarifying Treatment Toner — COSRX | Petal & Rose', 'A refreshing toner that rebalances skin, preps it for the rest of your routine and improves the look of texture and pores.');
