    'Cosrx Advance Snail 96 Mucin Power Essence by COSRX — a essence curated for the modern skincare routine. A lightweight hydrating essence that layers moisture into skin and preps it to absorb the rest of your routine. Presented in a 100 ml size for consistent, everyday use.', 'A lightweight hydrating essence that layers moisture into skin and preps it to absorb the rest of your routine.', 1450, 1450, 38,
