    'Cosrx The Vitamin C 23 Serum by COSRX — a serum curated for the modern skincare routine. A concentrated treatment serum formulated to target your key skincare concerns with visible, results-driven actives. Presented in a 20 ml size for consistent, everyday use.', 'A concentrated treatment serum formulated to target your key skincare concerns with visible, results-driven actives.', 1700, 1700, 32,
