    '["Hydration"]', '["https://holyskin.fr/cdn/shop/files/Missha-Super-Aqua-Ultra-Hyalron-Foaming-Cleanser-4_1920x.webp?v=1778406194","https://holyskin.fr/cdn/shop/files/Missha-Super-Aqua-Ultra-Hyalron-Foaming-Cleanser-4_1920x.webp?v=1778406194"]', 'https://holyskin.fr/cdn/shop/files/Missha-Super-Aqua-Ultra-Hyalron-Foaming-Cleanser-4_1920x.webp?v=1778406194',
    'Missha Ultra Hyalron Foaming Cleanser — MISSHA | Petal & Rose', 'A gentle yet effective cleanser that lifts away impurities, excess sebum and makeup residue while leaving skin soft, comfortable and balanced.');
