    VALUES ('COS-SNAIL92-TUBE-50', 'Cosrx advance snail 92 all in one cream (Tube)', 'cosrx-cosrx-advance-snail-92-all-in-one-cream-tube', 13, 1,
    'Skincare', 'Cream', '50 ml',
    'Cosrx advance snail 92 all in one cream (Tube) by COSRX — a cream curated for the modern skincare routine. A nourishing cream that floods skin with moisture and helps strengthen the skin barrier for a plump, healthy-looking complexion. Presented in a 50 ml size for consistent, everyday use.', 'A nourishing cream that floods skin with moisture and helps strengthen the skin barrier for a plump, healthy-looking complexion.', 900, 900, 40,
